{%- comment -%}
  PG Gift Purple: the gift line's SAVE 100% stops moving and paints the same
  purple as every other pill in the cart.

  WHAT WAS ACTUALLY WRONG. Not the colour, and not the phase. The gradient on
  .pg-gift-off is character for character the one pg-drawer gives .pg-save-chip
  and .pg-free-tag, and both carry `animation:pgShift 5s ease-in-out infinite`.
  The difference is how long each element LIVES:

    - .pg-save-chip is created fresh by pg-drawer's pgDeals every time the
      drawer rebuilds -- `chip = document.createElement('span')` at pg-drawer:535
      -- and the drawer's innerHTML is replaced on every cart change. A CSS
      animation restarts when its element is created, so those pills are
      permanently near 0% of the sweep and read as one steady purple.

    - .pg-gift-off is created once and then deliberately left alone: this
      session's cart script only ever writes it when its text differs, on the
      "settle, do not fight" rule that stopped the earlier flicker bugs. Which
      means it is the one pill that actually runs the full five-second sweep,
      over and over, with the colour visibly travelling through it.

  So the animation was never the shared behaviour -- it was an accident of the
  others being short-lived. Per the owner: copy the others.

  THE FIX. Pin the pill to the paint the others sit at: no animation, and
  `background-position:0% 50%`, which is where a freshly-created chip starts.
  With background-size at 240% the visible window is the leftmost ~41.7% of the
  gradient regardless of the pill's width, so a wider pill shows the same ramp of
  colour, not a different slice of it. Nothing to measure, nothing to keep in
  sync, and no JavaScript -- an earlier version of this file matched the phase
  and the pixel scale at runtime, which was solving a problem the owner did not
  have.

  The gradient itself is restated so all four properties are set together and
  none can be left over from the rule this overrides.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  #cart#cart#cart .pg-gift-off,
  body.template-cart .pg-gift-off{
    background-image:linear-gradient(120deg,#9B4BC4 0%,#7A2FA2 30%,#4A1C66 50%,#7A2FA2 70%,#9B4BC4 100%) !important;
    background-size:240% 240% !important;
    background-position:0% 50% !important;
    background-repeat:no-repeat !important;
    animation:none !important;
  }
</style>
